SUPABASE CONFIGURATION - CRITICAL
When working with Supabase in this project, ALWAYS use the values from the .env file:
- VITE_SUPABASE_URL is already set correctly in .env
- VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is already set correctly in .env
- The supabase client is already configured in src/lib/supabase.ts
- NEVER hardcode different Supabase URL or key values
- NEVER replace the existing environment variables with placeholder or example values
- ALWAYS import and use the existing supabase client from 'src/lib/supabase'
